Optional private collection retrieval directly uses Orchard Photos v0.5.0:
https://github.com/chaseleantj/orchard-photos
Pinned commit: 24cf2821e2bcc57cb9a25ececc05d9f7c3e0b86c
The project-local installer retains its original LICENSE and source, including
server/scanner.py, server/semantic.py, and server/cache.py, without rewriting
the embedding/preprocessing/ranking implementation. The adapter limits scan
inputs to registered private photos and sets scanner concurrency to one.

